+    """Register-A fragments for one 64x128 native-E4M3 WGMMA A tile.
+
+    The payload is the shared-expert FP8 layout: per 64-row quarter there are
+    four K32 groups, and each group is 128 lane vectors of 16 contiguous bytes.
+    A lane vector holds (row0,k..k+3), (row1,k..k+3), (row0,k+16..k+19),
+    (row1,k+16..k+19), with row0=(idx//32)*16+(idx%32)//4 and k=(idx%4)*4.
+    """
+    idx = warp * 32 + lane
